@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FBFCFE
object "vehicles : SampleGroup<HeavyRover>" as vehicles #DDF2EE {
  第一筆參考 = heavy
}
object "mixed : SampleGroup<SampleSource>" as mixed #E7EFF5 {
  第一筆參考 = heavy
}
object "同一台 heavy : HeavyRover" as heavy {
  energy = 8
  samples = 6
  actionCount = 2
}
object "第一步 : MissionStep" as step #FBEED7 {
  command = 1
  energy = 14
  result = 成功
}
vehicles --> heavy : get(0) 為 HeavyRover
mixed --> heavy : get(0) 為 SampleSource
step -[hidden]-> heavy
note bottom of step
日誌保存當時數值，
不是目前能源的參考。
end note
note bottom of heavy
群組不複製車輛，也不執行新行動。
end note
@enduml
